{{!
    @template mod_skilland/lesson_card

    The inside of one lesson card of mod_skilland/lesson_list, shared by the playable
    (link) and the not playable (div) card.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * showlabel - Whether the lesson code badge is shown.
    * label - The lesson code, like L1.2.
    * title - The lesson title, already formatted by format_string().
    * meta - The updated date and score line, empty when there is neither.
    * scomissing - Whether to warn a teacher that the lesson is missing from the package.
    * icon - The Font Awesome icon of the progress status.
    * statustext - The progress status.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "showlabel": true,
        "label": "L1.1",
        "title": "What is testing?",
        "meta": "Updated: 27/09/26 · Score: 80%",
        "scomissing": false,
        "icon": "fa-check-circle",
        "statustext": "Completed"
    }
}}
{{#showlabel}}
<div class="skilland-lesson-number">{{label}}</div>
{{/showlabel}}
<div class="skilland-lesson-content">
    <span class="skilland-lesson-title">{{{title}}}</span>
    {{#meta}}
    <div class="skilland-lesson-meta">{{meta}}</div>
    {{/meta}}
    {{#scomissing}}
    <div class="alert alert-warning skilland-lesson-sco-missing small py-1 px-2 mt-1 mb-0">{{#str}}lesson_sco_missing, mod_skilland{{/str}}</div>
    {{/scomissing}}
</div>
<div class="skilland-lesson-status">
    <i class="fa {{icon}} skilland-status-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span class="skilland-status-text">{{statustext}}</span>
</div>
